{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:39 2026-10-26 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:39 2026-10-26 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:39 2026-10-26 HKT</p><img alt=\"白鷺團體一眾成員領獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/36f9f08161004ae65e279b31c3c53428/2026-10/179301084977389.jpg\"/><p>今日在澳門高爾夫球鄉村俱樂部舉行的首屆「NZB高爾夫球錦標賽」(NZB Golf Championship)，由紐西蘭販馬公司（New Zealand Blookstock）主辦，出席的練馬師、騎師及馬主眾多。</p><p>賽事其間，新西蘭駐香港總領事陸德（Peter Lund）將紐西蘭販馬公司「紐西蘭星級賽駒獎」頒發予「白鷺金剛」的馬主白鷺團體；另將紐西蘭販馬公司「紐西蘭冒起新星」頒發予「越駿聯歡」的馬主陳東、盧永文、關華與黃廸欣，並由黎昭昇代領。</p><img alt=\"「蜜蜜送」馬主岑健龍\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/80b69248a21c54a74bffdbaea9b43e2c/2026-10/179301087815898.jpg\"/><img alt=\"新西蘭駐港總領事Peter Lund\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/81f503c8fb232ee4e897a28be24e607a/2026-10/Peter_Lund_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"鄧思高代表白鷺團體發言。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f16d24038e0563b5d0221e891db4774/2026-10/179301087873745.jpg\"/><img alt=\"黎昭昇（中）代「越駿聯歡」馬主領獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d643344dcef489c29e38756dd9d9c449/2026-10/179301087880255.jpg\"/><img alt=\"黎昭昇發言。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dc81c38addb24e50fb7df78c0ba73996/2026-10/179301087843743.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:37.081433+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:39.886481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:23.633901+00:00","content_hash":"863dd63786e991a732aee8e981f853b923c3636a5477be8da88b2c63a1affd94","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}